                                "target_word": "umíráček",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c298037c-8b0d-3224-8893-2a364fb5e59b",
                                        "entry_id": "f712376c-c233-3d10-bb0f-11c94b1814b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "kostelní zvon, kterým se zvoní na znamení toho, že někdo umřel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f263254-7dd4-470f-aeb0-abdfec67fe75",
                                                "sense_id": "c298037c-8b0d-3224-8893-2a364fb5e59b",
                                                "text": "Kostelní zvony na západě Řecka v neděli vyzváněly umíráčky na protest proti novému zákonu, který lidem usnadňuje změnit si pohlaví."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6319699d-fbf8-4e66-913b-6550587a0ace",
                        "source_entry_id": "f4d0d46f-ffd1-3ebd-ae89-e3c320e17a45",
                        "source_sense_description": "annonce de la fin de quelque chose",
                        "target_lang_word": "death knell",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "death knell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e53855c-1711-3ff6-864b-dc7781a9ba32",
                                        "entry_id": "47ae2c85-5844-3092-b6a2-e7c9c863a5e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The tolling of a bell announcing death."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b64e6793-cfc3-427a-908e-855a776cdebc",
                                                "sense_id": "7e53855c-1711-3ff6-864b-dc7781a9ba32",
                                                "text": "The sound was the stroke of a bell from the tower of East Endelstow Church. […] The death-knell of an inhabitant of the eastern parish was being tolled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fdbd885-6151-4e17-8d66-4182d2674021",
                                                "sense_id": "7e53855c-1711-3ff6-864b-dc7781a9ba32",
                                                "text": "Its recurrence was regular, but as slow as the tolling of a death-knell."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b13fb606-3e93-3d82-8373-62a2b14644ab",
                                        "entry_id": "47ae2c85-5844-3092-b6a2-e7c9c863a5e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A marker, sign or omen foretelling the imminent end, death or destruction of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13c808b3-6e33-400d-a1c0-411d726024fa",
                                                "sense_id": "b13fb606-3e93-3d82-8373-62a2b14644ab",
                                                "text": "The thought was a death-knell to Helen's last hope, and she sank down, quite overcome;[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c33c7c7-f13b-4f75-82cf-f73195642a71",
                                                "sense_id": "b13fb606-3e93-3d82-8373-62a2b14644ab",
                                                "text": "\"It is the death knell of an orchestra if it doesn't have its own home,\" he says."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4288b53a-ddd0-49e1-a6dd-1d235cf41851",
                                                "sense_id": "b13fb606-3e93-3d82-8373-62a2b14644ab",
                                                "text": "The dirty little secret at the heart of Sex Box, in fact, was that it was a well-meaning and thoughtful anthropological experiment dressed up as a tawdry, tabloid-bating death knell for standards of common decency."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60bf331d-3e19-480f-b0a8-2fd5966f2aa0",
                                                "sense_id": "b13fb606-3e93-3d82-8373-62a2b14644ab",
                                                "text": "A rupture would represent a death knell for the West and would harm the US worker."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07fed1d2-f07c-4f2a-b6a9-d73c17470a31",
                                                "sense_id": "b13fb606-3e93-3d82-8373-62a2b14644ab",
                                                "text": "One day in the not too distant future, we may look back on Donald Trump’s return to power as the death knell of “liberal internationalism.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
